---
import Layout from '../../../../layouts/Layout.astro';import '../../../../styles/equipment.css';const d='/equipment/02-04/',nist='https://www.nist.gov/laboratories/tools-instruments/nanofab-tool-heidelberg-instruments-dwl-2000-laser-pattern-generator';
---
<Layout pageTitle="DWL 2000 dry pattern registration" description="Preview two inert geometric marks on a virtual blank without changing a wafer or operating a laser." wide={true}><article class="equipment" id="dwl"><nav class="eq-nav"><a href="/simulations/equipment/02-04/">← Equipment 02-04</a><a href="/simulations/equipment/">Register</a><a href="#dwl-evidence">Reference sheet</a></nav><header class="eq-mast"><p class="eq-meta">02-04 / GEOMETRY-ONLY PREVIEW</p><h2>Two marks define a rigid preview</h2><p class="eq-lede">Open the virtual inspection viewport and extend the dry carrier. Preview an asymmetric L and triangle on a blank, then change the rotation or pose. The simulation never exposes anything or changes a wafer.</p></header>
<div class="d-cols"><section><h3>Heidelberg DWL 2000</h3><canvas id="dwl-model" aria-label="Orbitable DWL 2000 cabinet, inspection viewport and dry coupon carrier"></canvas><p id="dwl-viewstatus" role="status">Loading metric GLB…</p><button id="dwl-front">Whole cabinet / reset</button><button id="dwl-chamber">Carrier close-up</button><button id="dwl-rear">Rear view</button><p>Click the viewport handle to open, the dry carrier tab to extend, or the blank to register a preview. The virtual movement is schematic.</p></section>
<section><h3>Inert layout and inspection pose</h3><p id="dwl-state"></p><div class="d-form">{[['x','Shift X, mm',-25,25,4],['y','Shift Y, mm',-25,25,-3],['angle','Rotation, °',-180,180,30],['error','Injected mark-spacing error, mm',0,6,0]].map(([id,label,lo,hi,v])=><label>{label}<input type="number" id={'dwl-'+id} min={lo} max={hi} step="any" value={v}/></label>)}<label>Annotation tone<select id="dwl-tone"><option value="bright">Bright marks</option><option value="dark">Dark marks</option></select></label></div><button id="dwl-viewport">Open virtual viewport</button><button id="dwl-carrier">Extend dry carrier</button><button id="dwl-preview">Commit dry preview</button><button id="dwl-reset">Restore example</button><p id="dwl-status" role="status"></p></section></div>
<section><h3>Inert fiducial readback</h3><canvas id="dwl-art" width="830" height="340" aria-label="Geometric layout preview showing asymmetric L and triangle"></canvas><p id="dwl-read" role="status"></p><button id="dwl-export">Download preview JSON</button><label>Read back a dry preview JSON <input id="dwl-import" type="file" accept=".json,application/json"/></label><p><a href={d+'example-preview.json'}>Example preview</a>. This file preserves tone, rotation, named marks, coordinates, revision and blank ID. It does not contain exposure, drive parameters or an aligner toolpath. Native aligner operation is not claimed.</p></section>
<section id="dwl-evidence"><h3>Reference and checks</h3><p>Original schematic cabinet modeled from the <a href={nist}>NIST NanoFab DWL 2000 equipment photograph</a> (cream case, warm viewport, front details). The 152.4 mm square is based on its documented 6-inch blank option. Cabinet and terminal dimensions, travel and internal geometry are inferred, not verified factory specifications; the dry preview is not a model of laser optics or writing.</p><div class="d-cols"><figure><img src={d+'station.webp'} alt="Original DWL cabinet reconstruction"/><figcaption>Original model matching the visual proportions documented by NIST; console is illustrative.</figcaption></figure><figure><img src={d+'carrier.webp'} alt="Original dry blank in inspection carrier with geometric marks"/><figcaption>Original dry carrier with asymmetric annotation geometry. No exposed specimen is depicted.</figcaption></figure></div><p>An orientation-preserving rigid transform aligns the vector between the two identified marks and then their midpoints. The determinant is +1, so the asymmetric symbols are not mirrored. Mark spacing differing by more than 0.20 mm is rejected. Two identified marks do not independently detect a mislabeled pair or arbitrary reflection.</p><table><thead><tr><th>Independent case</th><th>Expected</th><th>Actual</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>90° with shift (10, −2) mm</td><td>L(21, −19), T(3, 17) mm</td><td>Exact within floating precision</td></tr><tr><td>Dark preview reimport</td><td>Retain tone, ordering and pose</td><td>Preserved, waferModified=false</td></tr><tr><td>1 mm spacing discrepancy</td><td>Do not commit</td><td>Rejected</td></tr></tbody></table><p><a href={d+'build-model.py'}>Editable Blender source</a> · <a href={d+'dwl2000.glb'}>Metric GLB</a> · <a href={d+'registration.mjs'}>Rigid geometry and state actions</a> · <a href={d+'vr.json'}>VR ray bounds and nominal travel</a>. No headset validation claimed.</p></section></article></Layout>
<script>import '../../../../lib/equipment/02-04/client.mjs';</script>
<style is:global>#dwl .d-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1.1fr) minmax(0,1fr);gap:1rem}#dwl section{padding:1rem;border:1px solid var(--border);margin:1rem 0;min-width:0}#dwl :is(input,select,button){font:inherit;color:inherit;background:var(--panel);border:1px solid var(--border);padding:.45rem;max-width:100%;box-sizing:border-box}#dwl .d-form{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,minmax(0,1fr));gap:.4rem}#dwl label{display:grid;gap:.2rem;min-width:0;margin:.35rem 0}#dwl label :is(input,select){width:100%;min-width:0}#dwl button{margin:.35rem .25rem .2rem 0;cursor:pointer}#dwl button:focus-visible{outline:3px solid #b28d5e}#dwl button:disabled{opacity:.5}#dwl-model{display:block;width:100%;height:335px;touch-action:none}#dwl-art{display:block;width:100%;height:auto}#dwl figure{margin:.5rem 0}#dwl figure img{width:100%}#dwl table{font-size:.9rem;border-collapse:collapse;width:100%;text-align:left}#dwl td,#dwl th{border-bottom:1px solid var(--border);padding:.35rem}@media(max-width:780px){#dwl .d-cols{grid-template-columns:minmax(0,1fr)}#dwl-model{height:280px}}</style>
